      "title": "After 14 Years of ARMWRESTLING if I Could GO BACK in TIME & CHANGE Anything, WOULD I?",
      "summary": "In this video, I look back over 14 years of armwrestling training and ask a question I think every experienced athlete eventually asks: knowing everything I know now, what would I change?\n\nThe exercises. The programming. The obsession with strength. The mistakes. \n\nThe things I thought mattered that probably didn’t, and the things I underestimated that turned out to matter enormously.\n\nWould I protect my elbows differently? Would I train my biceps, wrists and hands differently? \n\nWould I spend less time chasing numbers in the gym? Or, after everything this journey has taught me, would I actually do it all again?\n\nThis isn’t a generic “5 armwrestling mistakes beginners make” video. It’s a genuine retrospective on what more than a decade in this sport has taught me about getting stronger, staying healthy and becoming a better armwrestler.\n\nIf you could restart your own armwrestling journey with everything you know today, what ONE thing would you change? \n\nDrop it in the comments.\n\nSubscribe for armwrestling training, analysis, technique, commentary and everything else from the world of armwrestling.\n\n#Armwrestling #ArmWrestlingTraining #StrengthTraining",
